@startuml ACTIVITY_DIAGRAM_ADMIN_LOGOUT_COMPLETE
title Activity Diagram - Admin Logout (Full System)

|Admin|
start
:Klik tombol "Keluar" di Sidebar;

|Sistem|
:Kirim permintaan logout ke Backend API\n(HTTP POST /api/v1/auth/logout);
:Form permintaan logout diterima;

|Database|
:Hapus data session aktif / masukkan token ke blacklist;
:Konfirmasi penghapusan data berhasil;

|Sistem|
:Hapus local authentication tokens\n(localStorage / cookies);
:Redirect browser ke halaman login\n("/admin/login");
:Tampilkan pesan "Logout Berhasil";

|Admin|
:Melihat halaman login;
stop

@enduml